  "notes": "{偏見|へんけん} combines ⟦{偏|へん}→偏：noentry⟧ (biased, one-sided) and ⟦{見|けん}→見：noentry⟧ (view).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {偏見|へんけん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{持|も}つ→持つ：00478_motsu⟧: to have prejudice\n- {偏見|へんけん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦なくす→なくす：01110_nakusu⟧: to eliminate prejudice\n- {偏見|へんけん}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{見|み}る→見る：00283_miru⟧: to look at with prejudiced eyes\n- {偏見|へんけん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{満|み}ちた→満ちる：02428_michiru⟧: full of prejudice\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{先入観|せんにゅうかん}→先入観：07312_sennyuukan⟧: preconception (more neutral)\n- ⟦{差別|さべつ}→差別：01633_sabetsu⟧: discrimination (action, not just attitude)\n- ⟦{固定観念|こていかんねん}→固定観念：07467_koteikannen⟧: fixed idea, stereotype",
